Package: lsda
Type: Package
Title: Course Materials for Longitudinal and Spatial Data Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Olatunji",
    family = "Johnson",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "olatunji.johnson@manchester.ac.uk")
Description: Datasets, teaching helper functions, interactive Shiny
    applications and 'learnr' tutorials supporting MATH48132 and MATH68132
    Longitudinal and Spatial Data Analysis at the University of Manchester.
    Installing this package provides every dataset and dependency used across
    the eleven teaching weeks in a single step, so that tutorial code runs
    without students having to locate and read data files themselves.
